<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  1.27 %		     C/S =  1.27 %</p>
<p>	    O/N =  1.27 %		     O/N =  1.27 %</p>
<p>	    T/N =  1.27 %		     T/N =  1.27 %</p>
<p>		   March 19, 1997		    March  18, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.76 %     1 month forward =  6.11 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.61 %     2 month forward =  7.12 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.67 %     3 month forward =  7.12 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.78 %     4 month forward =  7.04 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.85 %     5 month forward =  7.05 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.80 %     6 month forward =  7.03 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
